@HostAddress = http://localhost:5262
@ClientId = test-client-id
@AdobeId = CBJCHBCAABAA-replace-with-a-real-agreement-id

### Adobe Sign registration check: expect 200 and the client ID echoed back
GET {{HostAddress}}/webhooks/adobesign
X-AdobeSign-ClientId: {{ClientId}}

### Agreement event: expect 200 and the status keyword updated in OnBase
POST {{HostAddress}}/webhooks/adobesign
X-AdobeSign-ClientId: {{ClientId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "AGREEMENT_ACTION_COMPLETED",
  "agreement": { "id": "{{AdobeId}}", "status": "SIGNED" }
}

###
